        "text": "Despite some initial progress toward the Metaverse, there are still different opinions about what the metaverse is or should be. There are some people who believe that the metaverse will be driven by virtual reality, with users wearing VR headsets, fully immersed in virtual worlds, and disconnected from their real environment. Another camp believes that augmented reality should be the primary mode of interaction. Users wear AR glasses or other interface devices to access an extra informational layer of perception while staying present with their physical environment. Other companies believe mixed reality is a better option, where users interact with physical and virtual items. Mixed reality allows users to immerse themselves in the real world while interacting with virtual environments, essentially enjoying the benefits of both worlds. Still others believe digital twins will be what makes the metaverse genuinely revolutionary.",
        "start": 560,
        "end": 53700,
        "confidence": 0.9818694,
